rding to your GOALS\n\n\ud83d\udccaGet STATISTICS on your performance\n\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fChoose your favorite SCENARIO for an immersive experience: a virtual gym, the beach, or even the moon!\n\n\ud83e\udd4aTrain against yourself with our CHALLENGE mode\n\n\ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffdWorkouts created by PROFESSIONAL TRAINERS with guidance throughout the exercise\n\nAnd.. GYM CLASSES! Train as if you were in a fitness class from any location.\n\n If you have any questions, please contact us at exrciser-info@exrciser.com", "short_description": "Let your eXRcise flow\u2728"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "9519925031426521", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391818_9519925048093186_2497712314153753809_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q-5nPy9pRBMQ7kNvwHfKUhO&_nc_oc=Ado92wTAeg8AX5Mplt1R__IzUJTkcvQoILbC3u9qq43bDI1G4YbfMNiGRVdz-UMHu-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1bcqO91Jef9WYVevb-3nCGZ3nsdK8X1EJukeVu1woxPw&oe=69D90679"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape.png", "id": "1862608307847203", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391859_1862608314513869_3285969694731957563_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yLkqkhFQ-aMQ7kNvwGvHnof&_nc_oc=AdpP33u8fcQX8AGlw_-9cKeRVKhR2GRrqqHPB6wlulcquyT1TIRgNqwTEMJLIMFFeLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0XH7mNPbUhHBVYmgY24pqy7I_T6E4gKlwc7ZWtuQTrCA&oe=69D8ED75"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1812601472552535", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001654_1812601475885868_3798967773266755093_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gNlHUavl0qsQ7kNvwFk4CQP&_nc_oc=AdoFzu4BPYLnSb79vqIuXQx-NgPFXnqRyCAmcpi1jJqLetPCaKpRup5r2POluzkwvmw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0yxKQ9vcxn6Doth8k5ForELPh_rhP-0tVKN